# Cloudbound Moogle: "When this creature enters, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature" (CR 603.6a, 122.1). The target may be any creature: Bot1's own Ornithopter takes it (the Mox Pearl is not a creature and is refused). The counter is exactly one, so Ornithopter is 1/3, and the Moogle itself is a 2/3 flyer.

